        <mxCell id="c210" value="&lt;i&gt;Report view, page Ex 13.6 Revised, for fiscal 2026 except the charts by year and by month of the whole window. Each visual carries the model answer&#x27;s own title, naming the measure and the period. Services is a bar of its own, the line chart starts at zero, and the discounts share one axis with revenue, where they are small.&lt;/i&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#5D6D7E;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacing=2;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="592" width="860" height="53" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
